    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Pre Order For Dokan is a WooCommerce extension that adds pre-order functionality to your Dokan marketplace. It allows vendors to offer products for pre-order with customizable release dates and payment options.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable pre-orders for individual products</li>\n<li>Set release dates for pre-order products</li>\n<li>Choose between immediate or delayed payment</li>\n<li>Set pre-order limits</li>\n<li>Customize pre-order button text</li>\n<li>Email notifications for pre-order confirmation and release</li>\n<li>Compatible with Dokan marketplace</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload <code>pre-order-for-dokan</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to WooCommerce &gt; Settings &gt; Pre-Order to configure the plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='how%20do%20i%20enable%20pre-orders%20for%20a%20product%3F'>\nHow do I enable pre-orders for a product?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<ol>\n<li>Edit the product in WooCommerce</li>\n<li>Scroll down to the Pre-Order tab</li>\n<li>Check &#8220;Enable Pre-Order&#8221;</li>\n<li>Set the release date and other options</li>\n<li>Update the product</li>\n</ol>\n</p>\n<dt id='can%20i%20set%20different%20pre-order%20settings%20for%20different%20products%3F'>\nCan I set different pre-order settings for different products?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, each product can have its own pre-order settings including release date, payment type, and pre-order limit.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id='how%20do%20customers%20know%20when%20their%20pre-ordered%20product%20will%20be%20available%3F'>\nHow do customers know when their pre-ordered product will be available?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The release date is displayed on the product page and in the order confirmation email. Customers will also receive an email when the product is released.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Pre-order functionality for Dokan marketplace.",
    "description": "<p>Pre Order For Dokan is a WooCommerce extension that adds pre-order functionality to your Dokan marketplace. It allows vendors to offer products for pre-order with customizable release dates and payment options.</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Enable pre-orders for individual products</li>\n<li>Set release dates for pre-order products</li>\n<li>Choose between immediate or delayed payment</li>\n<li>Set pre-order limits</li>\n<li>Customize pre-order button text</li>\n<li>Email notifications for pre-order confirmation and release</li>\n<li>Compatible with Dokan marketplace</li>\n</ul>\n",
